"    - L'addon [Qiskit Mitigation](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-mitigation/zne) per Qiskit\n"
"    - L'[opzione `zne_mitigation`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/options-models-resilience-options#zne_mitigation) con [`pea`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/options-models-zne-options#amplifier) come amplificatore se usi l'Estimator di IBM Quantum\n"

